# Keeps run logs, caches and research samples out of the deployed image.
#
# NOTHING under clients/ may ever be excluded. A blanket "*.md" here on 2026-09-16 cut
# every client's pitch.md, icp.md and exclusions.md out of the image, so the running
# service fell back to another client's positioning and refused to send -- correctly,
# but only because the profile guard caught it. Patterns are anchored to the repo root
# for that reason: a bare "*.md" matches at every depth.
/log-*.json
/stage3_cache_*.json
/measured_*.json
/one_vertical_result_*.json
/seeds_interested.json
/gated_verticals.json
/research_*.txt
/.backfill-progress.json

# Root documentation only. Never clients/**/*.md.
/README.md
/SPEC.md
/DEPLOY.md
/buzzlead-api-live.md
/buzzlead-api-reference (1).md
